DATA[Finance]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[Crypto Trading]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Binance launches SpaceX pre-IPO perps amid $2 trillion valuation bets]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/21/binance-launches-spacex-pre-ipo-perps</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/d3b0012ee91ace25714d9cd726e345705bb5bdd1-3000x1688.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">2d1c36c7-33a4-47a7-8247-532aa1967371</guid>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 07:03:20 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[Binance looks to democratize pre-IPO markets, starting with SpaceX perpetual futures.]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Omkar Godbole</dc:creator>\n      <content:encoded/>\n      <dc:description/>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets\"><![CDATA[Markets]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"tag\"><![CDATA[SpaceX]]></category>\n      <category domain=\"https://www.coindesk.com/\">News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title><![CDATA[Don't call us just a WLFI treasury company, says AI Financial ]]></title>\n      <link>https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/21/don-t-call-us-just-a-wlfi-treasury-company-says-ai-financial</link>\n      <media:content url=\"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/s3y3vcno/production/a6462c7e6b84bc721cb6296d10cf50ccf716cbb5-1600x1067.jpg?fm=jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;h=1080&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=clip\" type=\"image/*\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">36563d16-11b8-4114-8807-cc40b6c78775</guid>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 05:20:35 +0000</pubDate>\n      <description><![CDATA[The company says it is building a broader fintech, tokenization and digital infrastructure business, but its latest SEC filing shows WL