sting of State-Supervised Gold-Backed Stablecoin USDKG</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 10:28:20 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 21 May 2026 10:28:20 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/press-releases/osl-strengthens-asias-digital-asset-ecosystem-with-listing-of-state-supervised-gold-backed-stablecoin-usdkg</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/press-releases/osl-strengthens-asias-digital-asset-ecosystem-with-listing-of-state-supervised-gold-backed-stablecoin-usdkg?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9wcmVzc3JlbGVhc2VwYXJ0aWNsZXMtMS5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"OSL Strengthens Asia’s Digital Asset Ecosystem with Listing of State-Supervised Gold-Backed Stablecoin USDKG\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>OSL Group (863.HK) (OSL), a global stablecoin payment and trading platform, today announced that its Hong Kong-licensed digital asset exchange OSL HK has officially listed USDKG, the gold-backed stablecoin issued by the Kyrgyz Republic.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Advertorial</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9wcmVzc3JlbGVhc2VwYXJ0aWNsZXMtMS5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9wcmVzc3JlbGVhc2VwYXJ0aWNsZXMtMS5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Press Releases</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Silvergate’s Fraher breaks silence on settlement with Gensler’s SEC</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 07:38:46 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 21 May 2026 07:38:46 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/silvergates-fraher-breaks-silence-on-settlement-with-genslers-sec</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/silvergates-fraher-breaks-silence-on-settlement-with-genslers-sec?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1pbnNpZGUtbWFrZXJkYW8tZHJhbWExLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Silvergate’s Fraher breaks silence on settlement with Gensler’s SEC\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Former Silvergate executive Kate Fraher said the rule that prevented her from sharing her side of the story was unconstitutional. It was finally lifted by the SEC this week.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Brayden Lindrea</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1pbnNpZGUtbWFrZXJkYW8tZHJhbWExLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1pbnNpZGUtbWFrZXJkYW8tZHJhbWExLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Tax evaders are trying ‘novel digital assets’ to dodge authorities: Chainalysis</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 07:34:52 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 21 May 2026 07:34:52 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/criminals-attempt-to-use-bitcoin-ordinals-to-evade-authorities-chainalysis</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/criminals-attempt-to-use-bitcoin-ordinals-to-evade-authorities-chainalysis?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1jYW4tYml0Y29pbi1iZS1oYWNrZWQuanBn.jpg\" alt=\"Tax evaders are trying ‘novel digital assets’ to dodge authorities: Chainalysis\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Italian authorities uncovered a tax evasion scheme in which an individual allegedly used Bitcoin Ordinals and the BRC-20 token standard to generate and conceal $1.1 million. \n</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Stephen Katte</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1jYW4tYml0Y29pbi1iZS1oYWNrZWQuanBn.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1jYW4tYml0Y29pbi1iZS1oYWNrZWQuanBn.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Syndicate Labs winds down after 5 years, citing shrinking rollup market</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 07:30:06 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 21 May 2026 07:30:06 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-infrastructure-firm-syndicate-labs-closes-citing-shift-in-rollup-market</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-infrastructure-firm-syndicate-labs-closes-citing-shift-in-rollup-market?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9zdG9wLWNsb3NlZC1kb29yLXJlZ3VsYXRpb24tYmFuLWxvY2tlZC1kb29yLWJhbmstZGVsaXN0aW5nLmpwZw==.jpg\" alt=\"Syndicate Labs winds down after 5 years, citing shrinking rollup market\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>The Ethereum rollup market is dominated by Arbitrum and Base, which have a combined 68% market share, according to L2Beat. \n</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Martin Young</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9zdG9wLWNsb3NlZC1kb29yLXJlZ3VsYXRpb24tYmFuLWxvY2tlZC1kb29yLWJhbmstZGVsaXN0aW5nLmpwZw==.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9zdG9wLWNsb3NlZC1kb29yLXJlZ3VsYXRpb24tYmFuLWxvY2tlZC1kb29yLWJhbmstZGVsaXN0aW5nLmpwZw==.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>SEC seeks public comment as it weighs prediction market ETFs</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 05:44:37 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 21 May 2026 05:44:37 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-seeks-public-comment-as-it-weighs-prediction-market-etfs</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-seeks-public-comment-as-it-weighs-prediction-market-etfs?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1tb25leS1vci1hc3NldHMtaG93LWRpZmZlcmVudC1ndm50cy1kZWZpbmUtY3J5cHRvLWV0Zi5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"SEC seeks public comment as it weighs prediction market ETFs\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>Bitwise, Roundhill Investments and GraniteShares had their prediction market ETF applications put on hold by the SEC earlier this month.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Brayden Lindrea</dc:creator>\n      <media:content url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1tb25leS1vci1hc3NldHMtaG93LWRpZmZlcmVudC1ndm50cy1kZWZpbmUtY3J5cHRvLWV0Zi5qcGc=.jpg\" width=\"528\" medium=\"image\"/>\n      <enclosure url=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS1tb25leS1vci1hc3NldHMtaG93LWRpZmZlcmVudC1ndm50cy1kZWZpbmUtY3J5cHRvLWV0Zi5qcGc=.jpg\" length=\"528\" type=\"image/jpg\"/>\n      <category>Latest News</category>\n    </item>\n    <item>\n      <title>Hyperliquid ETFs surprise with 50% volume jump after slow launch</title>\n      <pubDate>Thu, 21 May 2026 04:36:42 +0000</pubDate>\n      <atom:updated>Thu, 21 May 2026 04:36:42 +0000</atom:updated>\n      <guid isPermaLink=\"true\">https://cointelegraph.com/news/hyperliquid-etfs-see-50-volume-jump-with-perfectly-timed-launch</guid>\n      <link><![CDATA[https://cointelegraph.com/news/hyperliquid-etfs-see-50-volume-jump-with-perfectly-timed-launch?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound]]></link>\n      <description><![CDATA[<p style=\"float:right; margin:0 0 10px 15px; width:240px;\"><img src=\"https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/528_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy1pbWFnZXMuY3RtZWRpYS5pby9tZWRpYS9hcnRpY2xlLWNvdmVycy9oaS13aGF0LWlzLWh5cGVybGlxdWlkLWhscC1hbmQtaG93LWRvZXMtaXQtd29yay1ldGYtMS5qcGc=.jpg\" alt=\"Hyperliquid ETFs surprise with 50% volume jump after slow launch\" class=\"type:primaryImage\"></p><p>ETF analyst Eric Balchunas says crypto and traditional assets are trading down while Hyperliquid is up, leading to a boon for ETFs tied to the token.</p>]]></description>\n      <dc:creator>Cointelegraph by Jesse Coghlan</dc:\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UN